#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/generate_plot_polygons_standard_process_raw_images_section_ground_control_points.mas:9
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_a_previous_imaging_event_on_this_field_experiment_has_already_completed_the"
msgid "If a previous imaging event on this field experiment has already completed the standard process and has ground control points (GCPs) defined, then that imaging event can be used to automate the rest of the standard process on this new imaging event."
msgstr "Si un evento de captura anterior de este ensayo ya completó el proceso estándar y tiene puntos de control terrestre (GCP) definidos, puede usarse para automatizar el resto del proceso estándar del nuevo evento."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas:93
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_a_previous_imaging_event_on_this_field_experiment_has_already_completed_the_standard_process_then_that_imaging"
msgid "If a previous imaging event on this field experiment has already completed the standard process, then that imaging event can be used to automate the rest of the standard process on this new imaging event."
msgstr "Si un evento de captura anterior de este ensayo ya completó el proceso estándar, puede utilizarlo para automatizar el proceso del nuevo evento."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas:94
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_ground_control_points_gcps_were_defined_for_a_previous_imaging_event_then_gcps_can_automate_the_standard"
msgid "If ground control points (GCPs) were defined for a previous imaging event, then GCPs can automate the standard process for this new imaging event."
msgstr "Si se definieron puntos de control terrestre (GCP) para un evento anterior, pueden automatizar el proceso estándar del nuevo evento."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:22
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_it_is_not"
msgid "if it is not."
msgstr "si aún no existe."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:2529
#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:2719
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_it_is_not_make_sure_the_planting_date_is_also_set"
msgid "if it is not. Make sure the planting date is also set!"
msgstr "si aún no existen. Asegúrese también de establecer la fecha de siembra."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:2611
#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:2797
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_the_coordinate_system_of_the_imaging_event_is_either_utm_of_wgs84_then_the"
msgid "If the coordinate system of the imaging event is either \"UTM\" of \"WGS84\", then the orthophoto images must be GeoTIFFs (.tiff) containing the coordinate system. If the coordinate system is \"Pixels\", then the orthophoto images are simple raster images (.tiff, .jpeg, .png)."
msgstr "Si el sistema de coordenadas del evento es \"UTM\" o \"WGS84\", las imágenes deben ser GeoTIFF (.tiff) que incluyan el sistema de coordenadas. Si es \"Pixels\", use imágenes ráster simples (.tiff, .jpeg, .png)."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas:783
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_the_image_looks_good_with_the_applied_threshold_click_save_otherwise_you_can_start_over"
msgid "If the image looks good with the applied threshold, click Save. Otherwise, you can start over."
msgstr "Si la imagen con el umbral aplicado se ve bien, haga clic en Guardar. De lo contrario, empiece de nuevo."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:24
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_you_already_have_orthophotomosaic_image_s_of_your_entire_field_from_externa"
msgid "If you already have orthophotomosaic image(s) of your entire field from external software, you can upload those images. Upload orthomosaics as .TIFF, .PNG, or .JPG images. Do not upload GeoTIFFs, instead upload reflectance raster images (.TIFF, .PNG, or .JPG). Orthophotomosaic images for multi-spectral cameras are expected to be perfectly super-imposable for all spectra."
msgstr "Si ya tiene ortofotomosaicos de todo el campo creados con software externo, súbalos como .TIFF, .PNG o .JPG. No suba GeoTIFF; suba imágenes ráster de reflectancia (.TIFF, .PNG o .JPG). Las imágenes multiespectrales deben poder superponerse con precisión para todas las bandas."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas:31
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_you_find_any_of_these_tools_useful"
msgid " if you find any of these tools useful"
msgstr " si le resulta útil alguna de estas herramientas"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas:731
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_you_have_a_nir_band_you_can_calculate_normalized_difference_vegetative_index_ndvi"
msgid "If you have a NIR band, you can calculate \"Normalized difference vegetative index\", NDVI."
msgstr "Si dispone de un canal NIR, puede calcular \"Normalized difference vegetative index\", NDVI."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas:732
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_you_have_an_rgb_image_you_can_calculate_visible_atmospheric_resistant_index_vari_or_triangular_greenness_index"
msgid "If you have an RGB image, you can calculate \"Visible atmospheric resistant index\", VARI, or \"Triangular greenness index\", TGI."
msgstr "Si dispone de una imagen RGB, puede calcular \"Visible atmospheric resistant index\", VARI, o \"Triangular greenness index\", TGI."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:23
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_you_have_raw_aerial_images_tiff_jpg_png_that_have_not_been_stitched_into_an"
msgid "If you have raw aerial images (.TIFF, .JPG, .PNG) that have not been stitched into an orthophotomosaic image of the whole field, your raw images should be uploaded using a zipfile (.zip). Include at least 25 images in the zipfile. OpenDroneMap will be used to stitch the orthophotos and digital surface maps (DSM). OpenDroneMap works for color RGB images and for MicaSense 5-channel multi-spectral images."
msgstr "Si las imágenes aéreas sin procesar (.TIFF, .JPG, .PNG) no están ensambladas en un ortofotomosaico de todo el campo, súbalas en un ZIP (.zip), con al menos 25 imágenes. OpenDroneMap ensamblará los ortofotos y modelos digitales de superficie (DSM). OpenDroneMap funciona con imágenes RGB a color y multiespectrales MicaSense de 5 canales."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas:733
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_you_have_red_or_blue_or_green_or_images_from_any_spectral_band_you_can_calculate_ratios_to_use_as_your"
msgid "If you have red or blue or green, or images from any spectral band, you can calculate ratios to use as your vegetative index."
msgstr "Con red, blue, green o imágenes de cualquier canal espectral puede calcular relaciones para utilizarlas como índice vegetativo."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/drone_imagery/upload_drone_imagery_dialogs.mas:3063
msgctxt "drone.interface.if_you_selected_a_drone_run_do_not_try_to_make_a_new_one_at_the_same_time"
msgid "If you selected a drone run, do not try to make a new one at the same time!"
msgstr "Si seleccionó un evento de captura, no intente crear otro al mismo tiempo."

